{"id":"de_pression","lemma":"dépression","pos":"noun","rank":2877,"glosses":["depression (area that is lower than its surroundings)","depression (area of low atmospheric pressure)","depression (state of mind producing serious, long-term lowering of enjoyment of life or inability to visualize a happy future)"],"ipa":"/de.pʁɛ.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0d/Fr-d%C3%A9pression.ogg/Fr-d%C3%A9pression.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"dépressions"},"formAudio":{"dépressions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/37/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-d%C3%A9pressions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La dépression peut mener au suicide.","en":"Depression can lead to suicide.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to lead, to take"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"suicide"}]},{"text":"J'ai fait une dépression.","en":"I had a mental breakdown.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Je fis une dépression.","en":"I had a mental breakdown.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Est-ce que vous souffrez de dépression ?","en":"Do you suffer from depression?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to suffer","l":"souffrir"},{"g":"of / from"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"what"]]},{"text":"Quelle est la meilleure façon de surmonter la dépression ?","en":"What's the best way to overcome depression?","words":[{"g":"which?"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"best, better","l":"meilleur"},{"g":"way"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to overcome"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}